--- !u!1001 &2136586425
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.size
      value: 11
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneFinishDialogue.lines.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: I shall allow you to call upon my power.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Mother told power, evil.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Evil is a concept you can't fully grasp, you bafoon!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: 'Oh Bafoon, people call Ozzy that, how did you know '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Oh lord, what kind of interactions am I reduced to, how do I expect
        any help form this fool.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[5].text
      value: Ozzy can help, helping good
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[6].text
      value: Fool you are, but an honest one, let me tell you the power I will give
        you is no ordinary one.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[7].text
      value: Many have fallen in its pursuit, but somehow the fate chose you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[8].text
      value: It's name is long forgotten so you can call it ORC
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[9].text
      value: It controls the flow of time wih each step of yours.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[10].text
      value: But stay wary of THEM!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1928219248050799571, guid: 2fde870daa20e0242ae8978f46c59985, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onSceneEnterDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -6622881794113336343, guid: 98b8398e95729d14aa91ed4596446a7d, type: 3}
